  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic paste until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6358b56c88b83589f60746a3/step-29b12594.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While rice is cooking, roughly chop tomato and cucumber.\n• Cut haloumi into bite-sized pieces.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6358b56c88b83589f60746a3/step-c4fed3f9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine tomato, cucumber, mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• In another medium bowl, combine haloumi and cornflour (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6358b56c88b83589f60746a3/step-1f15e7d2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When rice has 10 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to cover the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, shake excess cornflour off and cook haloumi, tossing, until golden brown, 2-4 minutes.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6358b56c88b83589f60746a3/step-c2e8c5fa.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook Mumbai spice blend and ginger paste, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in coconut milk and simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add cooked haloumi and toss to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6358b56c88b83589f60746a3/step-d5c0d378.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Top with popcorn haloumi and spoon over Mumbai sauce.\n• Serve with tamarind chutney and cucumber salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6358b56c88b83589f60746a3/step-64db6e22.jpg"
    }
  ]
